><00:00:08.114><c>bert </c><00:00:08.116><c>paper </c><00:00:08.118><c>if </c><00:00:08.120><c>you're </c><00:00:08.122><c>curious  </c><00:00:08.124><c>it's </c><00:00:08.126><c>well </c><00:00:08.128><c>written </c><00:00:08.130><c>it's </c><00:00:08.132><c>easy </c><00:00:08.134><c>to  </c><00:00:08.136><c>understand  </c><00:00:08.138><c>the </c><00:00:08.140><c>main </c><00:00:08.142><c>thing </c><00:00:08.144><c>to </c><00:00:08.146><c>know </c><00:00:08.148><c>here </c><00:00:08.150><c>is </c><00:00:08.152><c>that </c><00:00:08.154><c>it  </c><00:00:08.156><c>can </c><00:00:08.158><c>be </c><00:00:08.160><c>a </c><00:00:08.162><c>real </c><00:00:08.164><c>pain </c><00:00:08.166><c>and </c><00:00:08.168><c>quite </c><00:00:08.170><c>complex </c><00:00:08.172><c>to  </c><00:00:08.174><c>implement </c><00:00:08.176><c>that </c><00:00:08.178><c>yourself  </c><00:00:08.180><c>but </c><00:00:08.182><c>the </c><00:00:08.184><c>data </c><00:00:08.186><c>collater </c><00:00:08.188><c>for </c><00:00:08.190><c>language  </c><00:00:08.192><c>modelling </c><00:00:08.194><c>will </c><00:00:08.196><c>do </c><00:00:08.198><c>it </c><00:00:08.200><c>for </c><00:00:08.202><c>you </c><00:00:08.204><c>when </c><00:00:08.206><c>you  </c><00:00:08.208><c>set </c><00:00:08.210><c>mlm </c><00:00:08.212><c>to </c><00:00:08.214><c>true </c><00:00:08.216><c>and </c><00:00:08.218><c>that's </c><00:00:08.220><c>an </c><00:00:08.222><c>example </c><00:00:08.224><c>of  </c><00:00:08.226><c>the </c><00:00:08.228><c>more </c><00:00:08.230><c>intricate </c><00:00:08.232><c>uh </c><00:00:08.234><c>pre-processing  </c><00:00:08.236><c>that </c><00:00:08.238><c>some </c><00:00:08.240><c>of </c><00:00:08.242><c>our </c><00:00:08.244><c>data </c><00:00:08.246><c>collaterals </c><00:00:08.248><c>do  </c><00:00:08.250><c>and </c><00:00:08.252><c>that's </c><00:00:08.254><c>it  </c><00:00:08.256><c>so </c><00:00:08.258><c>this </c><00:00:08.260><c>covers </c><00:00:08.262><c>the </c><00:00:08.264><c>most </c><00:00:08.266><c>commonly </c><00:00:08.268><c>used  </c><00:00:08.270><c>data </c><00:00:08.272><c>colliders </c><00:00:08.274><c>and </c><00:00:08.276><c>the </c><00:00:08.278><c>tasks </c><00:00:08.280><c>they're  </c><00:00:08.282><c>used </c><00:00:08.284><c>for </c><00:00:08.286><c>and </c><00:00:08.288><c>hopefully </c><00:00:08.290><c>now </c><00:00:08.292><c>you'll </c><00:00:08.294><c>know  </c><00:00:08.296><c>when </c><00:00:08.298><c>to </c><00:00:08.300><c>use </c><00:00:08.302><c>data </c><00:00:08.304><c>colliders </c><00:00:08.306><c>and </c><00:00:08.308><c>which </c><00:00:08.310><c>one  </c><00:00:08.312><c>to </c><00:00:08.314><c>choose  </c><00:00:08.316><c>when </c><00:00:08.318><c>you </c><00:00:08.320><c>have </c><00:00:08.322><c>for </c><00:00:08.324><c>your </c><00:00:08.326><c>specific </c><00:00:08.328><c>task</c>

